<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 281.5 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 281.5 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks bid for 110.5 million zlotys of the National Bank of Poland's 91-day NBP-bills and for 171 million zloty of 182-day NBP-bills, the bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
